      "side": 1,
      "message": "You mentioned that you avoid used [zephyr modules](https://docs.zephyrproject.org/3.1.0/develop/modules.html). I haven\u0027t looked at zephyr modules too much, but the docs make it look like it\u0027s meant for external code, such as this. What was the reason to avoid modules?",
